//Queue FIFO (First In First Out) principle follow karti hai.
enqueue() rear side par new element add karta hai, 
aur dequeue() front side se element remove karta hai.
Dynamic array new se memory allocate karta hai.
size current elements count karta hai,
jabki front aur rear positions ko manage karte hain.
